@baseUrl = http://localhost:5191

### Get all employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees

### Get one employee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/1

### Create an employee (expect 201 Created + Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara Ahmad",
  "email": "sara@acme.com",
  "position": "Customer Support",
  "team": "Team #1",
  "active": true
}

### Get the employee you just created (use the id from the Location header)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/3

### Get an employee that doesn't exist (should be 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/99
